バーチャルペットが大好き！  \n\n背景が透明な別バージョンをお願いします。SMS、サムネイル、youtube、twitchライブストリームなど、vtuberの用途に使用する予定です。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1QKK8WjTx9cKgOwz00yG2wPvhQ7LOzPAz", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yama_mari/works/39", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7ef09843/uploads/origins/aae475bc-bfcc-41b8-b470-9c9cb1e2c61c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=74d0cfeff943d6abf959c963f9e3820e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7ef09843/uploads/origins/aae475bc-bfcc-41b8-b470-9c9cb1e2c61c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=74d0cfeff943d6abf959c963f9e3820e, https://si.imgix.net/7ef09843/uploads/origins/aae475bc-bfcc-41b8-b470-9c9cb1e2c61c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6b39a750fae7e07036f0c53d204d368f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7ef09843/uploads/origins/aae475bc-bfcc-41b8-b470-9c9cb1e2c61c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4e6ce2b439f17dda4b08915fbd911228 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I would like to request a drawing of my persona, who is called MT for short https://x.com/mariotoadmk_/status/1967078438487159082?s=46&t=y_Jo3fJdCghH1zsyKSP6eA\nThank you", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yama_mari/works/38", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b4a7d928/uploads/origins/2652064c-4a2f-47b7-85c9-e4149ed03e0b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5432948074aed7f6d70eac4f567431db", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b4a7d928/uploads/origins/2652064c-4a2f-47b7-85c9-e4149ed03e0b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5432948074aed7f6d70eac4f567431db, https://si.imgix.net/b4a7d928/uploads/origins/2652064c-4a2f-47b7-85c9-e4149ed03e0b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a0ba5d71653d2038faee11178a9d4093 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b4a7d928/upl